  "title": "The Hackett Group® Establishes AI World Class Procurement Benchmarks",
  "summary": "Our New AI World Class Procurement benchmarks quantify how AI is reshaping procurement performance and reveal a growing gap between organizations that redesign work around AI and those that simply automate existing processes. The research shows AI World Class organizations can achieve up to 3.7X greater procurement ROI, 3X greater savings impact, and 55% more capacity for strategic supplier and sourcing decisions.",
